          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.22.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.22.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "PSA.57.1"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Zab 57:1",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "PSA.142.1"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "142:1",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Daudi oringo to kidho donjo i ŋungu tele cegin gi tindi Adulam. Munyo wutmin go gi ji je ma ot pa bamere jowinjo ni go nitie kenyo, jobino to joriwere gi go. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.22.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.22.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 22:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aka ŋatimoro je m'oyido nitie i kidamba, kisi ŋati m'oyido nitie i teko, kisi ŋati m'oyido nitie gi banja, aka kisi ŋati m'oyido nitie gi gwayo i cunye je jocokere bongi go; aka go olokere jatel pajo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.22.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.22.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 22:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.22.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.22.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 22:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Daudi omedere wok kenyo to kidho i tindi Mizipa iy'adec ma Mowab aka owaco ri kere ma Mowab ni, “Mondo akwayin, weyi baba gi mama jowobin jobedi ka tundo kam'anoŋey gima Were kidho timo ran.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.22.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.22.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 22:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ameno Daudi oweyo jonywol pere Mowab, aka jobedo kenyo i hongo je ma Daudi oyido pondo i ŋungu tele.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.22.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.22.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 22:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.22.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.22.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 22:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kenyo to jatuci wac Were Gad bino to waco ri Daudi ni, “Ikir'idoŋ i ŋungu tele ka; ngoye ka, aka kadhi i lowo ma Yuda.” Ameno to Daudi ngoye, aka okadho i lul ma Hereth.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.22.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.22.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 22:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.22.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.22.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 22:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndelo acel, Saulo oyido obedo i tipo i tiendi yath m'ilwoŋo ni tarmarisk i wi riete, aka oyido otiŋo toŋ pere i cinge; aka jolweny pere oyido jocungo jothoko go. T'iwaco rigo ni onwaŋ kama Daudi nitie iye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.22.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.22.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 22:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Saulo owaco ri jolweny pere m'oyido jocungo thoko go ni, “Winji win, cwo ma nono pa Benyamin! Wiparo ni Daudi janono pa Yuda me bende omiy win ndelin gi ndelo vini, to miyo win bedo jomituka jolweny pere? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.22.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.22.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 22:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Meno ay'atoŋa m'omiyo wicamo ran sereko? Ongoye kada ŋat'acel kwoŋ win m'owaco ran ni wodan ma an won anywolo oriwere gi wod pa Yese. Ongoye kwoŋ win ŋati m'odewo waco ran ni Daudi, acel kwoŋ cwo paran won rango nger ma nekan, aka ni kiri wodan omiyo go meni ma nekan.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.22.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.22.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 22:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.22.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.22.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 22:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.22.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.22.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1SA.21.8+1SA.21.9+1SA.21.10"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Sam 21:8-10",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "PSA.52.2"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Zab 52:2",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Doweg Jaedom oyido ocungo kenyo gi jolweny pa Saulo to dwoko ni, “Aneno Daudi munyo okidho Nob bongi Ahimelek wod pa Ahitub. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.22.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.22.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 22:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ahimelek openjo ri Daudi Rwoth gima Daudi otim to miyo go cemo moro g'abor pa Goliath Jafilistia.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.22.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.22.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 22:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.22.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.22.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 22:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ameno kere Saulo ooro nyatoro lwoŋo Ahimelek gi wade pere je m'oyido jobedo jocway ri Were i wi migam, aka jobino bongi Saulo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.22.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.22.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 22:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Saulo owaco ri Ahimelek ni, “Winji Ahimelek.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.22.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.22.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 22:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ahimelek odwoko ni, “An e jadwoŋ.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.22.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.22.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 22:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.22.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.22.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 22:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Saulo openjo Ahimelek ni, “Raŋo in gi Daudi wicamo ran sereko? Raŋo imiyo go cemo g'abor, aka ipenjo Were gima go otim? Onyo pama go owire ran aka rango nger ma nekan!”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.22.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.22.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 22:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.22.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.22.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 22:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "To Ahimelek dwoko ni, “Ŋa kwoŋ ŋecin perin je ma jar'adieri paka Daudi, go m'onywomo kiri nyarin, aka jatel pa jolweny perin, aka ji ma ot perin je joworo go! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.22.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.22.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 22:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Adieri apenjo rigo Were gir'atima, to meno k'obedo ma dicel an penjo rigo Were gir'atima. To ri camo rin sereko, jadwoŋ ikir'icwoki dhokan kosa ŋatimoro je ma peco paran. Ongoye gim'aŋeyo ma mako kwoŋ gime!”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.22.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.22.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 22:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.22.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.22.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 22:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kere owaco ri Ahimelek ni, “Ahimelek in gi wade perin je wiripo tho.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.22.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.22.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 22:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "To Saulo waco ri jolweny pere m'oyido jocungo cegin bonge ni, “Neki win jocway i wi migam pa Rwoth! Joriwere gi Daudi aka jok'owaco ran ni go oringo, kiri munyo oyido joŋeyo con.” To jolweny pere jokwero tiŋo cingi jo malo neko jocway i wi migam pa Rwoth. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.22.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.22.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 22:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ameno Saulo owaco ri Doweg ni, “Neki jo.” To Doweg neko joje. I ndelo no Doweg oneko jocway ri Were i wi migam piero aboro g'abic m'oyido joruko law pa jocway ri Were i wi migam. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.22.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.22.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 22:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Saulo doko to wodho or t'ineko ji je ma tindi Nob; tindi pa jocway ri Were i wi migam: Cwo, mon, nyithindho, nyithindho maŋic, dhok, punde, kodi rombo je oneki.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.22.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.22.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 22:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.22.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.22.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 22:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "To Abiatha, acel kwoŋ wot Ahimelek okwale aka okidho to riwere gi Daudi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.22.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.22.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 22:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abiatha owaco ri Daudi nger ma Saulo othumo iye jocway ri Were i wi migam. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.22.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.22.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 22:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Daudi owaco rigo ni, “Munyo aneno Doweg ndelo no Nob, aŋeyo ni go oyido lawaco ri Saulo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.22.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.22.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 22:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bedi kodan ka Ikir'ilwor. Saulo mito nekan kodi in je, to ongoye gima latimere rin k'ibedo bongan.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.22.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.22.23"
            ]
          }
        }
